      "fund": "Substack / Value & Momentum Portfolio",
      "date": "May 15, 2026",
      "summary": "The author presents a high-conviction thesis around LGCY's high-margin hybrid model and exclusive clinical placement agreements with California healthcare networks as an unpriced moat . This clinical inventory scarcity creates high barriers to entry, giving LGCY utility-like pricing power as it scales high-demand nursing and allied health programs. Driven by an aging population and high ROI for students, LGCY leverages countercyclical tailwinds without facing digital disruption risks.",
