      "summary": "The pitch examines LGCY's apparent deep-value profile\u2014trading at a low PEG ratio of 0.35 with tailwinds from healthcare labor shortages\u2014before making a detailed bear case based on regulatory and governance risks. The author highlights temporary Program Participation Agreements (PPAs) that cap enrollment growth, past compliance failures regarding Title IV fund returns, ineffective internal financial reporting controls, and Nevada re-incorporation that limits minority shareholder protections.",
